%N A038313 Triangle whose (i,j)-th entry is binomial(i,j)*10^(i-j)*11^j.
%D A038313 B. N. Cyvin et al., Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), pp. 109-121.
%F A038313 T(n,k) = 11*T(n-1,k-1) + 10*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Nov 15 2026
%e A038313 The triangle begins as:
%e A038313      1;
%e A038313     10,    11;
%e A038313    100,   220,   121;
%e A038313   1000,  3300,  3630,  1331;
%e A038313  10000, 44000, 72600, 53240, 14641;
%e A038313  ...
%t A038313 Flatten[Table[Binomial[i, j]10^(i-j) 11^j, {i, 0, 10}, {j, 0, i}]] (* _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Nov 15 2026 *)
